# CODEOWNERS — who must review changes to sensitive files.
#
# GitHub auto-requests a review from these owners on any PR touching the matched
# paths. With branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners" enabled,
# their approval becomes REQUIRED to merge. This keeps the content-editing
# automation (and marketing reviewers) from landing changes to CI, build config,
# dependencies, or the design tokens — those are Roger's call. Mirrors the
# "do not touch" list in CLAUDE.md.

/.github/workflows/      @rogerfoxcroft
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @rogerfoxcroft
/astro.config.mjs        @rogerfoxcroft
/package.json            @rogerfoxcroft
/package-lock.json       @rogerfoxcroft
/src/styles/global.css   @rogerfoxcroft
